rchived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-08-02T02:35:20Z","updated_at":"2025-11-24T15:29:23Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nfound in v4.5.beta4.official [2d113cc22]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta4 - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7602) - AMD Ryzen 9 5900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads) - 31.92 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nLight sources added to a scene massively increase its AABB, and when that scene is then instanced using 3D object snapping it gets put further from the surface than is desirable.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n* Create a scene with any 3D regularly sized mesh in it, such as a 1m box\n* add a light such as an omnilight to the scene\n* save the scene\n* make a new scene with some kind of geometry to place objects on such as a CSGBox expanded to make a platform\n* Drag the box/light scene from the FileSystem into the 3D viewport to place it with the mouse\n* Observe how the box will be floating quite far off the surface dragged onto. The distance it is floating is dependent on the range of the light source.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[3d-snapping-bug-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21561032/3d-snapping-bug-test.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109223/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109223/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}